      "content": "let go of the obligation to exist... i've never heard it put that way. everything i did, everything i sacrificed, it was for this life. but now it feels like i'm just a stranger here. is it actually okay to just... decide you've had enough? to decide that leaving is the only way to finally be at peace?",
